1
00:00:00,232 --> 00:00:01,762
KOOTHRAPPALI:
I wonder

2
00:00:01,767 --> 00:00:04,237
(Raj:)if he's listening
to our music right now.

3
00:00:04,236 --> 00:00:05,536
(Howard:)Could you imagine?

4
00:00:05,537 --> 00:00:07,467
(Howard:)What a cool way
for us to meet.

5
00:00:07,472 --> 00:00:10,942
(Howard:)He's playing our song and
looks up, and there we are...

6
00:00:10,942 --> 00:00:15,142
(Howard:)his favorite two-piece acoustic
sci-fi novelty rock band.

7
00:00:15,147 --> 00:00:16,617
(Raj:)And he's, all, like,

8
00:00:16,615 --> 00:00:19,785
"Aren't you the guys from
Footprints on the Moo...?"

9
00:00:19,785 --> 00:00:21,655
(Raj:)Ooh, what is he doing?!

10
00:00:25,023 --> 00:00:26,293
(Howard:)I can't watch.

11
00:00:26,291 --> 00:00:27,891
I-I-It's okay.

12
00:00:27,893 --> 00:00:29,763
(Raj:)Oh, it's okay.
He's done.

13
00:00:29,761 --> 00:00:31,961
Why is he looking at it?!

14
00:00:33,031 --> 00:00:36,401
(Raj:)Eh, no, he's not going
to eat it, is he?

15
00:00:36,401 --> 00:00:38,031
(Howard:)Come on, Trent,
you're better than...

16
00:00:38,036 --> 00:00:40,266
(both groaning)

17
00:00:42,674 --> 00:00:45,374
(Howard:)Let's just go.

18
00:00:45,377 --> 00:00:48,407
(Trent:)Hey, aren't you
the guys...?

19
00:00:48,413 --> 00:00:51,483
Nope!
Never heard of 'em!

20
00:00:52,584 --> 00:00:55,584
♪ ...Know if words could say ♪

21
00:00:55,587 --> 00:00:57,017
♪ But darlin',
I'll find a way... ♪

22
00:00:57,022 --> 00:00:58,922
(Sheldon:)I wonder why it was
this particular song

23
00:00:58,924 --> 00:01:00,454
(Sheldon:)that was stuck
in my head.

